# Canonical contributor identities.
#
# The landing page builds its contributor list from `git log`, which sees one
# identity per name/email pair — so the same person appears several times after
# switching machines or email addresses. This file collapses them.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
# The canonical email is the one GitHub can resolve to an account, so avatars
# resolve for the merged identity rather than the stray one.

